 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o3ivMA-cYJ0Q7kNvwG4qANJ&_nc_oc=AdqLu5-J0eVF1okZ2ObvnL5EFCe6qfxLeCZ4haUWgZ-TGWLL20Iubq4g-L6XyPQO20Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKq4MdFZqdUkBUV-wgCgpw7bIT8Rq3awumDoP5D9Er0cg&oe=6AB53F41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JfoDmKLT544Q7kNvwHSv4O6&_nc_oc=AdoWnKcrEIo3yJgdxMAlhDX0-WVfBYCO5U0Gz1VlcW8j21wh-4VYucKDgNbTboxBVgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLjhzOsjynJPTnXtCkW9xI4eUsNbgMeeNEKpILQceGsyA&oe=6AB54CA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=juta6uZRlGoQ7kNvwHcgvPe&_nc_oc=AdqD_Ai2JdOjGlN6ciNsL9gLQA0u4ClONnX-7Yn3QYO__dLPtobRk3jcL50_OogD88U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI9o9SvlIhUSVD0lGVMVsmX17XEYvS4SzXGk4YQG2VbqA&oe=6AB51E5C"}, {"fil